Subject: [PATCH] KEX: four views in a 2x2 grid, snap-out windows, built-in KEX
 suite

Four views, snap-out view windows and plugin gating for two-view
plugins. The KEX suite (PowerEditor/src/KexSuite, copied in by
kex-patch.sh) is built into notepad++.exe and gets its settings pages in
Settings > Preferences ("KEX Editing", "KEX Tabs", "KEX Windows"),
reachable from Settings > KEX Features.

Tab snapping: while a tab is dragged the core works out where it would
land (the side of a view a hidden view would open on, or another view)
and the suite draws the preview; with it on, a drop goes there instead
of showing the Move/Clone menu.

